            "date": 1770126184124,
            "name": "Commit-0",
            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>スマスイ | チーム参加</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"スマスイのチーム参加リンクです。アプリを開くか、ストアからダウンロードしてください。\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/icon.svg\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Quicksand:wght@600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n      * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n      }\n\n      :root {\n        --primary: #2563eb;\n        --secondary: #06b6d4;\n        --accent: #f97316;\n        --text: #1e293b;\n        --text-light: #475569;\n        --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);\n        --bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe 0%, #bae6fd 50%, #7dd3fc 100%);\n      }\n\n      body {\n        font-family: 'Nunito', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n        background: var(--bg);\n        color: var(--text);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 32px 20px;\n      }\n\n      .card {\n        width: min(520px, 100%);\n        background: var(--card);\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        padding: 28px 24px 30px;\n        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);\n        text-align: center;\n      }\n\n      .logo {\n        font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        font-size: 1.6rem;\n        color: var(--primary);\n        letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n      }\n\n      h1 {\n        font-size: 1.5rem;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n      }\n\n      p {\n        color: var(--text-light);\n        line-height: 1.7;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n      }\n\n      .details {\n        background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);\n        border-radius: 16px;\n        padding: 14px 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        text-align: left;\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\n      }\n\n      .details strong {\n        color: var(--text);\n      }\n\n      .buttons {\n        display: grid;\n        gap: 12px;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n      }\n\n      .button {\n        display: inline-flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        padding: 12px 18px;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        border: 1px solid transparent;\n        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n      }\n\n      .button-primary {\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));\n        color: white;\n        box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\n      }\n\n      .button-secondary {\n        background: white;\n        color: var(--primary);\n        border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);\n      }\n\n      .button:hover {\n        transform: translateY(-2px);\n      }\n\n      .note {\n        font-size: 0.85rem;\n        color: var(--text-light);\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">スマスイ</div>\n      <h1>チーム参加</h1>\n      <p>このリンクからアプリが起動します。アプリが未インストールの場合はストアからダウンロードしてください。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"details\" id=\"details\">\n        <div><strong>チーム名:</strong> <span id=\"team-id\">-</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"buttons\">\n        <a class=\"button button-primary\" id=\"open-app\" href=\"#\">アプリを開く</a>\n        <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/%E3%82%B9%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B9%E3%82%A4/id6756019486\">App Storeでダウンロード</a>\n        <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=jp.smartswim.app\">Google Playでダウンロード</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"note\">ヒント: アプリがインストール済みなら通常は自動で起動します。</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n      const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      const teamName = params.get('teamName');\n      const teamId = params.get('teamId');\n\n      document.getElementById('team-id').textContent = teamName || teamId || '-';\n\n      const iosUrl = `jp.smartswim.app://team/join?teamId=${encodeURIComponent(teamId)}`;\n      const androidUrl =\n        `intent://team/join?teamId=${encodeURIComponent(teamId)}` +\n        `#Intent;scheme=jp.smartswim.app;package=jp.smartswim.app;end`;\n      const isAndroid = /Android/i.test(navigator.userAgent);\n\n      const openApp = document.getElementById('open-app');\n      openApp.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        window.location.href = isAndroid ? androidUrl : iosUrl;\n      });\n    </script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
        }
    ]
}